# React Component Rules

## Server vs Client

```tsx
// ✅ Server — Insight list, article detail, static marketing sections
export default async function InsightPage({ searchParams }: Props) {
  const articles = await getArticles()
  return <NewsCard … />
}

// ✅ Client — forms, navbar menus, carousels, theme, filters
"use client"
export function ContactForm() { … }
```

**`"use client"` hanya jika:** useState, event handlers, browser APIs, carousel, theme, interactive filters.

**Jangan di:** layout data fetch, SEO schema wrappers, pure presentational cards fed by props.

## shadcn/ui — Wajib
Install via CLI first. Wrap, jangan edit `src/components/ui/` kecuali override styling lewat Tailwind `className`. Pakai `cn()` untuk conditional classes.

Umum di situs ini: `button`, `input`, `textarea`, `dialog`, `accordion`, `tabs`, `checkbox`, `sonner`.

Custom **hanya** jika tidak ada di shadcn/ui.

## Marketing + Insight UI
- Satu file = satu komponen (`NewsCard`, `FeaturedInsight`, `ContactForm`, …)
- Server fetch di page / lib; client handle interaksi
- Images: prefer `SmartImage` / `next/image` dengan alt yang bermakna
- Loading: existing skeleton components — jangan spinner custom sembarangan

## Performance
- `next/font` dengan `display: "swap"`
- Dynamic import hanya untuk komponen berat
- Insight list: pagination / filter via `searchParams` — jangan dump seluruh artikel ke client tanpa perlu
- Keep portfolio/static catalogs in `src/app/data.tsx` structured; don't duplicate huge datasets in components
